{
  "name": "Aegis of Rime (Cryomancer)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain Resistance to cold damage.</p><p>Additionally, when you cast a spell of 1st level or higher that deals cold damage, you form a protective layer of magical ice on yourself.</p><p>While under this effect, the first time you take damage, that damage is reduced by an amount equal to your sorcerer level + your Charisma modifier. The effect then ends on you.</p>",
